# Pairs with ClearedVictimHasRepairedBackLink. Clearing while the successor
# still points at the retired leaf leaves writes and reverse scans a stale link.
MODULE: ClearBeforeBackLinkRepair
TARGET: ClearedVictimHasRepairedBackLink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the victim is cleared before its successor back link is repaired
PERTURBS: ClearVictim

--- FIND
ClearVictim ==
    /\ ready
    /\ pending = "victim"
    /\ ~linked
    /\ ~routed
    /\ backLinkCorrect
    /\ victimExists
--- REPLACE
ClearVictim ==
    /\ ready
    /\ pending = "victim"
    /\ ~linked
    /\ ~routed
    /\ victimExists
--- END
